   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "h9yDCHB8BQAJ",
   "from": "Terrence Jorgensen",
   "author": "3fe90052fbf2f899",
   "date": "2019-04-24T16:15:39Z",
   "subject": "Re: How to set covariance equal to 1 between variables",
   "parts": [
    [
     2,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px\"><div style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px\"><font size=\"4\" face=\"arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">B ~~ 1*E </font></div></div></div><font size=\"4\" face=\"arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">C ~~ 1*F </font><div><div style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px\"><div style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px\"><font size=\"4\" face=\"arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"> B~~ C <br></font></div></div><div style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px\"><font size=\"4\" face=\"arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"> E~~ F</font></div></div></div></blockquote><div><br></div></div>"
    ],
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div>You additionally need to constrain correlations consistent with this hypothesis that B and E are the same variable, and that C and F are the same variable.  In other words, there is only 1 correlation between those 2 variables ({BE} with {CF}):</div><div><br></div><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\">B</span><span style=\"color:#660\">~~</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> cor</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">label</span><span style=\"color:#660\">*</span><span style=\"color:#000\">C <br>B</span><span style=\"color:#660\">~~</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> cor</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">label</span><span style=\"color:#660\">*</span><span style=\"color:#000\">F<br><br>E</span><span style=\"color:#660\">~~</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> cor</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">label</span><span style=\"color:#660\">*</span><span style=\"color:#000\">F<br>E</span><span style=\"color:#660\">~~</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> cor</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">label</span><span style=\"color:#660\">*</span><span style=\"color:#000\">C</span></div></code></div></div>"
    ],
    [
